    {
        "text": "Gavial, how do we play the whirlwind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "text": "What you want to do is grab the person's legs or hands, then start spinning in a circle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you're ready, just let go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "It sounds really fun! I want to try!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure. I'll just catch the Doctor after... Oh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, you're finally awake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, it's the Doctor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kay, don't tackle the Doctor like that. Crush those organs and that one won't stay with us for long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, sorry, Doctor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
