    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Are you both alright?;......;Was that you who just slapped me?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine. This isn't high enough to scare me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh oh. Don't tell me you tripped and lost your memory again, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I have amnesia.;And who might you be, Ma'am?",
        "values": "4;5"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't forget, I'm a doctor too. The real, medical kind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if you're cracking jokes, I guess you're good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;3;4;5"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, Doctor, let me catch you up on what happened while you were napping.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Short version is: we crashed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We fell from a very high place! Whooooosh\u2014\u2014! Kaboom! Like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Please elaborate.;......;I want the whole story!",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch, fine. Basically, Doctor, you're bad luck. During the attack, something exploded by your seat and you slammed into the wall there and passed out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, I took care of your wounds. Nothing major. Besides, you're healthier now than when you first showed up at Rhodes Island. Nice work, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Urk... Sorry, Doctor. I should have caught you, but the loud noises scared me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Can't blame you for that. To be honest, I never would have expected these bastards to have anti-air weapons.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "So you thought someone would attack us?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure. Did I forget to tell you? My people love to fight, not that any of them could take me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "What about the others?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When we were going down, everybody else jumped early to stabilize our altitude.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ceobe and I jumped last, to stick with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, and Lancet-2 should still be on the aircraft.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Where's the aircraft?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think it's that way. Should be just over the hill.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Let's go check on it.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
